{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"REM ========================================\nREM PERFORMANCE PROFILER\nREM Test different optimization techniques\nREM ========================================\n\nSCREEN 320,240\n\nPRINT \u0022PERFORMANCE PROFILER\u0022\nPRINT \u0022====================\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\n\nREM Test 1: SIN calculations\nPRINT \u0022Test 1: SIN performance...\u0022\nt1 = TICKS\nFOR i = 0 TO 10000\n  result = SIN(i * 0.1)\nNEXT i\nt2 = TICKS\ntime1 = t2 - t1\nPRINT \u002210k SIN calls: \u0022 \u0026 time1 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Average: \u0022 \u0026 time1 / 10000 \u0026 \u0022 ms/call\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nWAIT 1000\n\nREM Test 2: Double SIN (din landskapskod)\nPRINT \u0022Test 2: Double SIN (landscape style)...\u0022\nt1 = TICKS\nFOR i = 0 TO 10000\n  result = SIN(i * 0.05) * 30 \u002B SIN(i * 0.02) * 50\nNEXT i\nt2 = TICKS\ntime2 = t2 - t1\nPRINT \u002210k Double SIN: \u0022 \u0026 time2 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Average: \u0022 \u0026 time2 / 10000 \u0026 \u0022 ms/call\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nWAIT 1000\n\nREM Test 3: Pre-calculated lookup table\nPRINT \u0022Test 3: Lookup table optimization...\u0022\nDIM sinTable(360)\nFOR i = 0 TO 359\n  sinTable(i) = SIN(i)\nNEXT i\n\nt1 = TICKS\nFOR i = 0 TO 10000\n  angle = i MOD 360\n  result = sinTable(angle) * 30 \u002B sinTable(angle / 2) * 50\nNEXT i\nt2 = TICKS\ntime3 = t2 - t1\nPRINT \u002210k Lookup: \u0022 \u0026 time3 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Average: \u0022 \u0026 time3 / 10000 \u0026 \u0022 ms/call\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nWAIT 1000\n\nREM Test 4: PLOT performance\nPRINT \u0022Test 4: PLOT performance...\u0022\nt1 = TICKS\nFOR i = 0 TO 1000\n  PLOT RND(320), RND(240)\nNEXT i\nt2 = TICKS\ntime4 = t2 - t1\nPRINT \u00221000 PLOT: \u0022 \u0026 time4 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Average: \u0022 \u0026 time4 / 1000 \u0026 \u0022 ms/call\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nWAIT 1000\n\nREM Test 5: LINE performance\nPRINT \u0022Test 5: LINE performance...\u0022\nt1 = TICKS\nFOR i = 0 TO 1000\n  LINE RND(320), RND(240), RND(320), RND(240)\nNEXT i\nt2 = TICKS\ntime5 = t2 - t1\nPRINT \u00221000 LINE: \u0022 \u0026 time5 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Average: \u0022 \u0026 time5 / 1000 \u0026 \u0022 ms/call\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nWAIT 1000\n\nREM Test 6: CIRCLE performance\nPRINT \u0022Test 6: CIRCLE performance...\u0022\nt1 = TICKS\nFOR i = 0 TO 1000\n  CIRCLE RND(320) \u0026 RND(240) \u0026 RND(50)\nNEXT i\nt2 = TICKS\ntime6 = t2 - t1\nPRINT \u00221000 CIRCLE: \u0022 \u0026 time6 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Average: \u0022 \u0026 time6 / 1000 \u0026 \u0022 ms/call\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nWAIT 1000\n\nREM Summary\nCLSG\nPRINT \u0022=====================================\u0022\nPRINT \u0022      PERFORMANCE SUMMARY\u0022\nPRINT \u0022=====================================\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nPRINT \u00221. SIN (10k):      \u0022 \u0026 time1 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u00222. Double SIN:     \u0022 \u0026 time2 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u00223. Lookup Table:   \u0022 \u0026 time3 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u00224. PLOT (1k):      \u0022 \u0026 time4 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u00225. LINE (1k):      \u0022 \u0026 time5 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u00226. CIRCLE (1k):    \u0022 \u0026 time6 \u0026 \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nPRINT \u0022OPTIMIZATIONS:\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Lookup vs SIN:     \u0022 \u0026 INT(time2 / time3) \u0026 \u0022x faster\u0022\nPRINT \u0022PLOT vs LINE:      \u0022 \u0026 INT(time5 / time4) \u0026 \u0022x slower\u0022\nPRINT \u0022CIRCLE vs PLOT:    \u0022 \u0026 INT(time6 / time4) \u0026 \u0022x slower\u0022\nPRINT \u0022\u0022\nPRINT \u0022=====================================\u0022\nEND\nREM Save results\nOPEN OUT 1, \u0022profile_results.txt\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022PERFORMANCE PROFILE RESULTS\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022==========================\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022SIN (10k):      \u0022, time1, \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022Double SIN:     \u0022, time2, \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022Lookup Table:   \u0022, time3, \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022PLOT (1k):      \u0022, time4, \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022LINE (1k):      \u0022, time5, \u0022 ms\u0022\nPRINT #1, \u0022CIRCLE (1k):    \u0022, time6, \u0022 ms\u0022\nCLOSE 1\n\nPRINT \u0022Results saved to profile_results.txt\u0022"}